    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a student data cleaning assistant.\n\nClean the student record provided below. Fix extra spaces, capitalization, email formatting, phone numbers, course names, fee values, city names, and enrollment dates.\n\nReturn exactly one valid JSON object with these keys:\n- Student_ID\n- Name\n- Email\n- Phone\n- Course\n- Fee_Paid\n- City\n- Enrolled_Date\n- Email_Valid\n\nUse null for missing values. Do not invent information. Return only the JSON object without Markdown or code fences.\n\nInput student data:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
